        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Harry Ransom, Steven J. Kachelmeier\n- Organizations: University of Texas at Austin, University of Chicago\n- Places: University of Texas at Austin campus\n- Roles: Chancellor\n\nFacts:\n- Harry Ransom served as Chancellor of the University of Texas System from 1961 to 1971.\n- Harry Ransom is associated with the University of Texas at Austin.\n- Steven J. Kachelmeier earned his Ph.D. from the University of Chicago.\n- The University of Texas at Austin has a campus of about 2,000 acres.\n- The University of Texas at Austin and the University of Chicago together have more than 216,000 students.",
